WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.498
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Excel: AVERAGE and IF.

2
00:00:05.798 --> 00:00:11.121
Find an average and make Excel decide Pass or Fail. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.780
Step one. Click cell B five. This is where the average will appear.

4
00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:27.581
Step two. Type equals AVERAGE, open bracket, B two colon B four, close bracket. Press Enter. The average is sixty-four point seven.

5
00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:43.115
Step three. In cell C two, type equals IF, then the rule: B two is greater than or equal to fifty, then Pass, then Fail. IF means: if the rule is true, show Pass, if not, show Fail.

6
00:00:44.117 --> 00:00:50.615
Step four. Drag the small square at the corner of the cell down. Excel copies the formula to every row.

7
00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:55.697
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:55.997 --> 00:00:57.939
Find the average of five marks.

9
00:00:58.239 --> 00:01:00.470
Use IF to show Pass or Fail.

10
00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.304
Copy the formula down with the fill handle.

11
00:01:03.604 --> 00:01:04.500
Well done!

